  "text": "## Executive Summary  \nFirstUK Bank maintains a comprehensive Customer Identification Policy (KYC) to ensure customer legitimacy, prevent financial crime, and comply with regulatory requirements. This policy establishes mandatory procedures for verifying customer identity and address at account opening and periodically thereafter.  \n---",
